Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第29集 终局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}时间来到了五月中旬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:29.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It was now the middle of May
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管迪丽斯库阿特农场 显得一切都很美好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:35.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and although everything appeared to be wonderful at Diddly Squat Farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我关于买一个酒吧 并在八月银行假期之前开业的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:40.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}my dream of buying a pub and getting it open by the August Bank Holiday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}却正在变得遥不可及
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}was slipping away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（马蹄铁 母猪与猪）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.28,0:00:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的办公室看起来就像 温斯顿·丘吉尔地堡里的作战室
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.28,0:00:50.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}My office looked like the war room from Winston Churchill's bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（拳击兔 福克斯旅馆 马车与马）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是马车与马酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's the Coach & Horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 贴满四面墙壁的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But instead of Nazi tank divisions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:01:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是纳粹的坦克师 而是当地正在出售的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:01:00.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}my walls were plastered with photographs of local hostelries that were up for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这些酒吧都存在问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:06.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's something wrong with all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个"安静的女人" 不是真正的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:09.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, oh yeah, there's The Quiet Woman. Not really a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是我想要的 这个"拳击兔"有点太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:13.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not really what I want. That! The Boxing Hare, is slightly too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"麦瑞莫斯"有点太大了 还有哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:16.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Merrymouth, slightly too big. Where else are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"克利夫顿公爵"交通不便
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Duke at Clifton's got access problems
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一家酒吧名不副实 它叫"风车"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:24.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and another pub that isn't quite as good as The Windmill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（风车）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是 我会花一大笔钱买一处
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:29.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But would I spend what is a very considerable amount of money
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}野合场所吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:32.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}on a dogging site?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（花园 野餐区）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我得说 "来吧 家人们 来享受新鲜的农场美食"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:35.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll say, "Come on, families. Come and enjoy this farm-fresh food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.48,0:01:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"别在意车里那对情侣"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.48,0:01:39.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Excuse that couple in the Austin Maestro there."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太让人头疼了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果能让西牛津郡区议会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:45.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If we could get West Oxfordshire District Council
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}放弃将这里划为野餐区域
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:49.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to lose the picnic site, declassify it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那就太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:51.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但这毕竟是西牛津郡区议会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:53.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it's West Oxfordshire District Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很不情愿地让查理寻找更多选择
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:01.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Reluctantly, I asked Charlie to find more options...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}并在接下来的几天埋头干农活
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:08.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And spent the next couple of days doing farmering jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你是说 由于引擎罩是电动的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:32.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What you're saying is because the bonnet is electric
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 手刹也是电动的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:33.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-and the handbrake is electric... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以必须有一块备用电池 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:36.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-There has to be a secondary battery? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是备用电池出了问题 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:39.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's what went wrong? That's what went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大部分工作都是例行公事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:43.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Most of the chores were pretty routine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 每年的这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, at this time of year,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}总是有一项工作让我满怀期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:53.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}there's always one I really look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是今天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Today is the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}奶牛们 你们要出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Cows, you're going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一直是冬天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:05.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's been winter, winter, winter, winter, winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}冬天 夏天来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}winter, winter, summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 太神奇了 没有春天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:08.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-I know, amazing. No spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}缺了春天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:09.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Missed spring. Summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}进去 来吧 进去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In you go. Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}上去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:12.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}今天是自由日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Today is Freedom Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天 你看 多美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:19.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}God, it's just... Look how beautiful everything looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 太美了 让我又开始庆幸 自己生活在英格兰了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:22.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. It's perfect. Just makes me happy to live in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看那个 看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:24.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有意思的是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:28.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, what's interesting is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布说 如果不趁现在把奶牛赶到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:32.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb was saying if we don't get them out there like now, these cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这些草就会长得太高
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:35.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}this grass will be too long for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我完全无法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:37.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which I can't understand at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么会有草长得太高的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know how grass could be too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}杰哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}G-Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每次见到杰哥出来活动 我都很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:46.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Always nice to see the G-Dog out and about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, are we ready? I sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 奶牛们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:51.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}出来吧 开心点 你们开心我也开心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:55.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, be excited. It makes me happy when you're excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 你出来了 看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:57.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Hey-up! You're out, you're out. Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太美妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:03.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那种声音 听
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:06.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, that sound! Listen, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然它们没有翩翩起舞或者撒欢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:14.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they may not have danced and run around,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这已经让人很满足了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:16.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but that's quite satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}回到院子里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:20.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Back at the yard...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:21.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}直着倒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:21.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Straight. Straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:25.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我让卡莱布解释一下草的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:25.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa! I asked Kaleb to explain the grass issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我还是不明白 为什么草长高了它们就不吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:29.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause I still don't understand why they won't eat long grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}基本上 羊喜欢吃这么高的草 这么高 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:33.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's basically the sheep like it like this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}奶牛喜欢用舌头缠住草 把草拔起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:34.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Cows like it like this so they can get their tongue round it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从而获得最多的营养 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and pull it out and get the most nutrition out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果草长到这么高 营养就会跑到下面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:40.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If it gets to here, the plant nutrition is down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}顶端开始结籽 没有多少营养
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:43.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The top is bulking to get to seed, and there's no nutrition in that really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}奶牛明白这一点 懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And the cow knows, if that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 说真的 它们很清楚自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:49.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that is, honestly, they're properly into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}放完奶牛后
