Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:12.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I received a call from the Merchant of Doom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说他需要召开紧急会议
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:17.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}saying he needed an urgent meeting.
