Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:19.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We have some pretty significant news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go.
