Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:30.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is Neil Warner, the planning advisor that we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尼尔给西牛津郡区议会打了电话
