Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们说可以废除那个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:38.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They said we could get rid of that agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}允许公众去那里野餐的协议
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that allows people to come and picnic there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}西牛津郡区议会 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:45.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-West Oxfordshire District Council... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说我们可以废除那个协议
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Have said we can get rid of the picnic site?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说他们很乐意废除那个协议
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:50.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Have said they're happy to get rid of the agreement, yeah.
