Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们竟然同意了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:15.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and they go, "Yeah, that's fine."
