Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以他们很乐意 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:25.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So they're very happy to... Fucking hell.
