Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:43.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then hit that. Hit that! Hit that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么突然加速了 别碰方向盘 为什么这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:47.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! Why has it suddenly roared off? Why are we going a million?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么这么快 你做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:52.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Why is it going so fast? What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.44,0:12:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}按那个红色小按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.44,0:12:54.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hit... Hit that little red button.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么按钮 别碰方向盘
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What red button? Don't touch the steering wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:59.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What fucking button?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:01.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么时速240公里 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:07.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why is it going at 150 mph? I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（服务报警）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Stop the tractor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是怎么回事 太吓人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What the fuck was that all about? It was terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我也很害怕 因为我坐在驾驶舱里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:18.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was scared as well 'cause I'm in your cab!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道吧 有人买了特斯拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:21.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is why... You know these people who buy Teslas
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在高速公路上边开车边看电影
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:24.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then drive down the motorway watching a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.68,0:13:26.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后还纳闷为何会撞车 然后就撞车了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.68,0:13:26.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-And then they wonder why they crash. They crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现代技术不靠谱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:29.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Modern technology doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}后来我才发现 不靠谱的其实是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:34.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I then realised that actually it was me that didn't work
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为定速巡航仍然设定在时速50公里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:39.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because I still had the cruise control set at 31 mph
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我在来的路上设定的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}from the road journey up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}设为20
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:45.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, go to twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}20 我们假装刚才的事没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:47.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Twelve. Shall we just pretend that didn't happen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}回去再来一次吧 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:50.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and go back over there and do it again? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"启动自动驾驶"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:53.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Steering engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在它将替你驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:56.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And now it'll steer for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我没打算走直线 它在替你驾驶 它在自动驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:58.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-I'm not going in a straight line, look. Yeah, look, it's steering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它没有 方向盘都没动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Look, it's doing it. The steering wheel isn't moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}方向盘不会动 它是通过轮轴控制方向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:03.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, the steering wheel don't move but it controls it down on the axle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:04.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以方向盘已经断开连接了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So the steering wheel is no longer connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有断开 只是它通过轮轴来控制转向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:10.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it is. It just steers it down on the axle down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去 太聪明了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell, that's clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}三 二 一 升起来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:16.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Three, two, one: lift it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 很好 掉头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:20.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go. Well done. Turn yourself around,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}直到拖拉机跟这条线对齐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}until your tractor is lined with that line there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 放下播种机
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. Drop your drill down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:32.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 向前开 别碰方向盘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:32.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, drive forwards. Don't touch the steering wheel at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}慢慢向前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:33.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Gently drive forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等那个按钮变成白色 就按下它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And when that button goes white, press it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}准备 按
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Any minute... Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:38.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看着方向盘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:38.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Watch the steering wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 你看 它开始下一行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:41.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh my God, look, it's gone on the next line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且它不用你所说的"螯钳"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:44.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it'll match up dead straight without even using the "earywigs",
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就能对直
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:45.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}as you call them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我可以大摇大摆地坐在这里 完全不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:53.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I can literally just sit here like this and I look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 只是要记住 我的拖拉机在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:54.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, as long as you remember that my tractor's just there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}别撞上了 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't hit it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就在卡莱布认为我可以单独操作时 查理来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:03.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie arrived just as Kaleb decided I was ready to fly solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:04.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"系统已启用"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:06.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}System engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 它在自动驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:09.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go, look, it's steering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我好像已经上手了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:13.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, I think I've got the hang of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特不会再有滑稽的错误了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:16.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No more comedy errors at Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}想看笑话的话 你得去看《乡村档案》了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:21.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You'll have to watch Countryfile now if you want a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:22.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ha-haa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很骄傲 这是骄傲的时刻 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:28.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I feel really proud. It's a proud moment, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果能够长出来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:29.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it will if it grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个问题的答案 要再等几个礼拜才能揭晓
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:34.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}For the answer to that, we'd have to wait a few more weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}于是我把注意力转到了 一个需要在未来几天内
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:41.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I turned my attention to a problem that needed sorting out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}解决的问题上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in the next few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于我大概率会买下那个酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:47.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}As it now seemed likely I'd get the pub,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要增加肉类供应 这意味着需要买一头公牛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:52.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I needed to increase my meat supply which meant... buying a bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们这是去见 我们去见本·威尔逊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:55.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And now we're seeing... Now we're seeing Ben Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在这方面 我有个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:59.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And on that front, I'd had rather a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想让我们的纯种短角牛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:03.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I want to take our pedigree Shorthorn cows
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}与一头更大的公牛交配
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:07.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and mate them with a bigger bull,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这样产下的牛体型更大 会有更多的肉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:11.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so that we get a bigger animal and therefore more meat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}送到餐厅出售
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:13.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to sell in the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's my thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 问题在于
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的牛群是名贵品种 对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:18.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got a very expensive herd. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是奶牛中的梅赛德斯奔驰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:21.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They are Mercedes-Benz of cows, are they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们很不错 好吧 它们很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They're very nice. Very good. Okay, they're lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我吃不出来 纯种牛肉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:28.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, I couldn't tell the difference between pedigree beef...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:30.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 与非纯种牛肉的区别
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:30.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. And not-pedigree beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:32.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah... I agree with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:35.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要试着创造一种
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:35.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What we've gotta do is try and produce something that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想要自家养殖的本地优质牛肉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:39.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I want good, homegrown, local meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不一定要来自梅赛德斯奶牛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:43.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it doesn't necessarily have to come from a Mercedes cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我在考虑起亚奶牛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:46.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm thinking, like a Kia cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}起亚奶牛不错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:47.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kia cows are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}起亚是好车 没什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:50.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kias are good cars. I mean, there's nothing wrong with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}到了养牛场之后 我问了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:55.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}As we arrived at the bull farm, I asked a question
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也许早该想到的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:58.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that I probably should have thought of earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想问问 一头公牛要多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can I just ask, how much is a bull?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里吗 四千或五千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:04.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here? Four or five thousand pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不会吧 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:05.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这家养牛场是最 你想要一头起亚奶牛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:09.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You've come to the most expens... You want to create a Kia cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}结果你跑到了宾利的车库来找
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:14.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you've come to the Bentley garage to get one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们是在用宾利和梅赛德斯交配
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:17.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So what we're doing is we're crossing a Bentley with a Mercedes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}想要得到一头起亚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:19.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To get a Kia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}养牛场的主人奥利弗·里德
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The bull farmer, Oliver Reed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}带我们看了待售的小公牛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:28.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}showed us the young bulls that were for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这些牛的年龄介于18个月和两岁之间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:32.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}These are anything between 18-month and 2-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这些已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:34.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}These are now ready? These are ready for...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们将从中选一头 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:36.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So we'd have one of these? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 在正式谈生意之前
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:39.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, before we got down to business,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:44.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他带我看了 我要买的小牛长大后的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:44.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}he showed me what my purchase would look like when fully grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去 老天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy shit! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这也太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:53.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That... is a unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它的体重是1200公斤多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:56.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He's just over 1,200 kilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它重约一吨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So he's about one ton,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}睾丸就有四分之一吨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:02.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then he's got a quarter of a ton of nut sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它温顺吗 是的 它很 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:06.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And is he quite docile? Ah, yeah. He's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:09.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我看不一定 我感觉它在说 "看什么看"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:09.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not sure I'd say, "Who are you looking at?" to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}想牵着它走一圈吗 想遛遛它吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you wanna lead him round? Do you want to walk him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}牵着就行了 向前走 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:19.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}问题在于 它体重一吨半
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:19.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, I mean, the thing is, he weighs a ton and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}感觉就像牵着一艘油轮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:21.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like pulling an oil tanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不要这样喷气 是啊 我也讨厌西班牙人 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:27.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't snort like that. Yeah, I hate the Spanish as well, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我从未参加过斗牛 听起来怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:30.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've never been to a bull fight. How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷 你好大一头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:32.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}God strewth, you're big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:36.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah! You're so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:38.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:42.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有一种直面巨物的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:42.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like being in the presence of greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就连你也有点目瞪口呆 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:45.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Even you're standing slightly gobsmacked, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}站在它面前 感觉它巨大无比
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:50.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm... I mean, standing in front of him, he's absolutely enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:53.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且很壮观 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:53.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And also magnificent. He's... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 带它回它的停车场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:56.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, take him back to his parking space.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们回到关小牛的地方 准备挑选一头买下来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:03.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We then went back to the youngsters to choose one to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你想买一头来繁育母牛 还是想繁育肉牛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:07.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you wanting one for breeding females or one for breeding beef?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:08.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}肉牛 肉牛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:08.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Beef. Beefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:11.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哪一头 那头 终局 对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:11.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Which one? That one? Endgame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"终局" 对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:12.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Endgame? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它要轻一些 但体型更大 它一直是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:16.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He's not as heavy but he's wider. He's the same right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它是体型最大的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:17.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So he's the widest one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}年龄也要小一些 它还是牛圈里年龄最小的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:20.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And he's younger. He's one of the youngest ones in the pen as well, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它非常棒 终局要多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:24.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, he's great. How much is Endgame?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}六千五
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:26.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Six and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你说用不了这么多的 我是说过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:30.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-You said that it wouldn't be that much. I did say it wouldn't be that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你说要多少
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What number did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}比你的报价低三成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:36.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I said about 30% less than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:38.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这下好了 我们想从 一个苏格兰人身上刮油水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:43.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is good. We're trying to get money out of a Scotsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要的是最小的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:45.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're taking the smallest one... Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:48.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在我看来是更好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:48.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, the better one, in my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.24,0:19:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}养牛场最棒的牛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.24,0:19:50.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It would be the best thing on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:52.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}比我新买的拖拉机还要棒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:52.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Better even than my new tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:54.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么牌子的 兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:54.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What kind's your new tractor? A Lambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:55.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你应该买芬特
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:57.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You wanna go for Fendts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布有一台芬特 他不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, Kaleb's got a Fendt. He doesn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:00.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:00.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}知道吗 卡莱布嘲笑你的围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:04.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know Kaleb was laughing at your fencing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你为猪圈搭的围栏 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:07.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-He was what? The fencing you put up for your pigs. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他在马路对面建了一个大门
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He put gates in across the road there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}柱子上下颠倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:11.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He put the posts in upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你说什么 再说一遍 大声点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:15.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm sorry, just say that again, only much louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他在路对面建了一个大门 但是柱子上下颠倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:19.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He put gates in across the road, but he put the post in upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:21.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布·库珀来到这个小农场 对 干活
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:26.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb Cooper came to do a job. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 把柱子上下颠倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:30.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And this little farmer put the posts in upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.72,0:20:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最妙的是 我们都知道这件事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.72,0:20:35.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The great thing is we all know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我会把这件事记在心里 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:38.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'm gonna keep that in my pocket. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后在他最意想不到的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:41.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And one day, when he's least expecting it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说出来笑话他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:43.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna bring it out of my pocket.
