Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们看 它个头好小
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:29.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw! Look! He's quite small.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它还是个宝宝 它是个宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:32.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He is a baby. He's a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你不说我还不知道 它叫什么名字 终局
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:35.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't know. What's his name? Endgame!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.80,0:25:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们简称它什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.80,0:25:37.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, what are we gonna call him for short?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.52,0:25:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}终局
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.52,0:25:39.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Endgame!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 终局
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:40.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, Endgame!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.92,0:25:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}挺纯正的 看起来很惊人 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.92,0:25:44.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, it's sort of... Front on, he just looks amazing, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.56,0:25:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}农场这边一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.56,0:25:53.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}On the farm front, everything was ticking along fairly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}终局将在牛圈中适应几天
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:58.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Endgame would have a few settling-in days in the shed
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.88,0:26:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们会把它放到草场去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.88,0:26:02.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}before we released him into the cow field.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管最近天公不作美
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:07.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And even though the weather had been a nightmare,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.44,0:26:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们总算是把庄稼都种上了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.44,0:26:10.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we had managed to plant all the crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特的另一个项目同样进展顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:16.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And there was another Diddly Squat project bubbling along nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.00,0:26:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎的新款香水和香氛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.00,0:26:20.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa's new range of perfumes and scents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.48,0:26:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不错 很适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.48,0:26:25.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is nice. That really suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.44,0:26:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很喜欢 当心点 这是男款还是女款
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.44,0:26:28.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh! I like that! Be careful of that. Is it for girls or men?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.28,0:26:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}双手通用
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.28,0:26:30.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That, er, it's ambidextrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.48,0:26:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 双手通用
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.48,0:26:31.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? Ambidextrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你是说男女通用吧 现在不能用这个性别词汇了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:35.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You mean unisex? You can't use that word anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.24,0:26:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以用 双手通用的意思是 左撇子或右撇子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.24,0:26:37.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You can. Ambidextrous means left or right-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"双手通用"可以有很多意思
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:40.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So ambidextrous says it's all manner of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.52,0:26:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}男女通用的意思是你可以分辨
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.52,0:26:42.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Unisex means you can identify
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.44,0:26:44.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}喷上以后自己是否喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.44,0:26:44.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}as whatever the bloody hell you like when you wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"双手通用"没有这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:47.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-I don't... You can't have... Ambidextrous doesn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.28,0:26:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你还不如在上面写上"菜花"呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.28,0:26:49.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You may as well write "cauliflower" on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.00,0:26:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}另外我想问问
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.00,0:26:51.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And also, can I just ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.76,0:26:53.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里面用了多少 迪丽斯库阿特出产的原料
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.76,0:26:53.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}how many Diddly Squat ingredients have you got in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.00,0:26:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很多 不 说实话 有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.00,0:26:56.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh, loads. No, come on, be honest. How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.52,0:26:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很多 你看 所有这些
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.52,0:26:59.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Loads, look. All of these here. Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.04,0:27:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"香草" 我们没种 对
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.04,0:27:02.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, vanilla: we don't do. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.56,0:27:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"佛手柑" 我们也没种 "橙子油"很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.56,0:27:06.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, bergamot: we don't do either. Orange oil is sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.48,0:27:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我在跟你说哪些是我们没种的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.48,0:27:08.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We don't do. These are the ones we don't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.24,0:27:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}剩下的都不错 "薰衣草" 丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.24,0:27:10.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Everything else is really good. No, you don't... Lisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.60,0:27:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.60,0:27:14.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The following day,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.80,0:27:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我本该帮着卡莱布 再送一批猪去屠宰场的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.80,0:27:19.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was supposed to help Kaleb send another batch of pigs off to the abattoir..
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.60,0:27:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 老大 来吧 小猪 快点 猪猪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.60,0:27:22.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, boss man. Go on, pig. Come on, piggie. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.36,0:27:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我没去 丽莎让我帮她测试香水
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.36,0:27:26.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But instead, Lisa had me back on perfume duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.76,0:27:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}喷嘴在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.76,0:27:28.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I don't know where's the nozzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.44,0:27:33.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这次是测试一款全新的原型 她称之为"湿"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.44,0:27:33.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This time, testing out a brand-new prototype she'd called "Wet".
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下 喷在身上感觉还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:36.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Hold on. It's beautiful once you put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.28,0:27:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}刚喷上去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.28,0:27:37.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Ogh... It's the first spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.76,0:27:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太难闻了 不难闻 这是刚喷上去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.76,0:27:39.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-It's horrible. It's not, it's just the first spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.00,0:27:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但也不该是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.00,0:27:41.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it shouldn't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.84,0:27:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}出了什么问题 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.84,0:27:43.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Well, what's gone wrong? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}和我的路虎车的油箱气味一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:46.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That smells exactly the same as the tank in my Range Rover.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.28,0:27:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}或者车用尿素 别激动
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.28,0:27:48.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}AdBlue or whatever it is. Well, steady on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这不对劲 你好 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:51.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not right. All right, K?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:53.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 你把那两头装车
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:53.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Morning. Hey, have you managed to load those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.76,0:27:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没瘸的那头送走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.76,0:27:55.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is the one that's not lame gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.88,0:27:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 那两头公的送走了 瘸的那头
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.88,0:27:58.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, so the two boys have gone, the one that was lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.60,0:28:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}外加十头母的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.60,0:28:00.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then the ten girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.24,0:28:01.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以十头母的 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.24,0:28:01.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw, sweethearts. So ten girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.00,0:28:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}两头公的 全都送走了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.00,0:28:03.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They all went. Two boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:04.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.20,0:28:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}总共是13头
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.20,0:28:06.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, so there's 13 in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.36,0:28:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我在采石场的顶部发现了一头猪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.36,0:28:08.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I found a pig up at the top in the quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你把我那头猪送走了 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:11.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-You didn't take my pig? Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.24,0:28:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是皮米利 不 那是我的宠物猪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.24,0:28:14.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's Pigmilly. No! That's my pet pig. You didn't take Pigmilly?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.84,0:28:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我以为皮米利还在下面
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.84,0:28:16.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, you said there was Pigmilly. I thought Pigmilly was still down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它真的很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:18.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, she was really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.04,0:28:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它现在在拖车上
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.04,0:28:20.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, she's on the trailer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.16,0:28:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 我们经营的是农场 不是宠物乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.16,0:28:26.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To be honest, we are running a farm here, not a petting zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:28.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我就想让它吃东西 别的猪却不许它吃
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:28.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I just wanted her to eat, and the others wouldn't let her eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.88,0:28:30.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它走的时候很肥
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.88,0:28:30.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, she was fat by the time she went, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.68,0:28:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没关系 你应该早点说的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.68,0:28:32.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-It's okay. You should've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.00,0:28:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我赞同卡莱布 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.00,0:28:34.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm on Kaleb's side on this one, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.16,0:28:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我什么都没说 不然你只会把它送到市场去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.16,0:28:36.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's why I didn't say anything because you would have just taken her to market.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.04,0:28:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}狗狗们 安静
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.04,0:28:38.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Dogs, be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.56,0:28:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我的角 什么角
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.56,0:28:41.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, that's my horn. What horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.44,0:28:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你要的鹿角 我把鹿角收上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.44,0:28:44.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All my deer horns you asked for. I've sourced them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 鹿角 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:46.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What...? Deer horns? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我没找你要过鹿角啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:50.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've not asked for any deer horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不管我是否要过 没过一会儿 鹿角到了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:56.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whether I had or not, moments later, there they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.36,0:28:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我没找你要过鹿角
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.36,0:28:58.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-I didn't ask for deer horns. You...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.96,0:29:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}当时我们在讨论 农场有哪些东西可以利用
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.96,0:29:00.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We were talking about things we can use from the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.04,0:29:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你说你希望商店只卖来自农场的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.04,0:29:03.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You said you only want things from the farm in the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.52,0:29:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}黇鹿 来自农场
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.52,0:29:04.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fallow deer, from the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.04,0:29:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个来自农场 好吧 这个不是 不过
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.04,0:29:07.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-And that comes from the farm? Well, no, this one doesn't. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.64,0:29:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是那头黇鹿 不过很漂亮 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.64,0:29:12.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Not that particular fallow deer! But aren't they beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.80,0:29:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来自方圆25公里以内吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.80,0:29:15.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Does it come from within 16 miles?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.28,0:29:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}非常接近25公里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.28,0:29:18.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it's been very close to 16 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.32,0:29:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很漂亮吧 你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.32,0:29:21.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In its day. Aren't they gorgeous? And look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.72,0:29:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看着像是驼鹿角
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.72,0:29:23.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It looks like a fucking moose horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.16,0:29:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不对 是黇鹿 这是北美驯鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.16,0:29:25.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-No, it's fallow deer. Yeah, that is a caribou.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.40,0:29:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.40,0:29:27.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And this...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.52,0:29:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看 狗狗零食 加拿大境内25公里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.52,0:29:30.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Look. It's sixteen miles in Canada! They're treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.52,0:29:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那个很漂亮 好了 我们来处理鹿角
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.52,0:29:33.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's rather beautiful. Right, so we've got antlers,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.56,0:29:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你得回去继续研究 你的"湿"香水了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.56,0:29:36.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and you've got to go back to the drawing board slightly on your "Wet", I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.60,0:29:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 很难闻吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.60,0:29:38.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}On the "Wet", yeah. Oh, does it smell bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.64,0:29:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}完全是乙醇的气味 乙醇 但是喷在身上之后
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.64,0:29:41.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-It really smells of ethanol. Ethanol. But it settles down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.60,0:29:42.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}气味就没那么浓了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.60,0:29:42.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Once you have it on it settles down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但是没人 人们走进商店
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:44.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but nobody's... In a shop that people will go in...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.92,0:29:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去 没错 这香水有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.92,0:29:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh, fuck. Yeah, exactly. Something's gone wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就在我忙着买公牛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:52.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whilst I'd been buying bulls,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.64,0:29:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}喂理查德·汉姆和测试香水时
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.64,0:29:55.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}feeding Richard Ham and testing perfumes,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.88,0:29:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}农场的生活就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.88,0:29:57.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}such is the life of a farmer,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.88,0:30:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}勘查员在忙着勘查那个酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.88,0:30:00.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the surveyors had been looking at the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.12,0:30:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很快 查理带着勘查报告来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.12,0:30:05.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And soon, Charlie arrived with their report.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.00,0:30:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们拿到了完整的勘查报告 那只是其中一半
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.00,0:30:08.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got the full survey back, 'cause that's only half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.04,0:30:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.04,0:30:10.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? Yep...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.56,0:30:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}报告非常 对
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.56,0:30:13.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's quite... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.08,0:30:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}报告非常详尽
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.08,0:30:16.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's quite full on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.48,0:30:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还要多久才能买下它
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.48,0:30:18.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How close are we now, do you think, to buying it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}希望这个周末就能达成交易
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:21.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, hopefully we're gonna exchange at the end of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.16,0:30:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是还有48个小时 对
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.16,0:30:24.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hours, then. 48 hours away. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我突然拿到了这份 厚度堪比《新约》的报告
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:28.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And now, suddenly, I've got this "New Testament".
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 他们突然间发现了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:30.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yes. What have they suddenly found?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.72,0:30:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们认为那个 屋顶要维修
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.72,0:30:33.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They've come up with the fact that, er, the roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.40,0:30:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是一项义务
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.40,0:30:36.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}er, is a liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.48,0:30:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们预计维修屋顶需要十五万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.48,0:30:41.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And they've put 150,000 pounds on that to repair it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.72,0:30:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}十五万英镑 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.72,0:30:45.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}150,000 pounds? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.08,0:30:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}用来维修屋顶 嗯 我想我们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.08,0:30:49.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-We need to spend on the roof? Well, I think we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你是否有冷水浇头的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:51.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is your happiness hoover on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.08,0:30:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那个公厕可能存在问题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.08,0:30:54.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's an issue potentially with the loos,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.68,0:30:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}取决于会有多少人使用它
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.68,0:30:57.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}depending on how many people we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.56,0:30:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们是怎么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.56,0:30:58.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which they...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.52,0:31:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要对公厕做些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.52,0:31:00.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So what do they say we need to do with the lavatories?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}重建公厕 他们认为 最多需要十万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:05.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Reposition them, sort it out. They think that's up to 100,000 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.72,0:31:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 就修个厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.72,0:31:07.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? For a lavatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.08,0:31:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}难道要修成那种 可以自动擦屁股的日本公厕
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.08,0:31:12.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it gonna be like one of those Japanese lavatory that wipes your bottom for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.96,0:31:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.96,0:31:13.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.80,0:31:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还不止这些 "石棉" 是啊 废话连篇
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.80,0:31:18.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-There's more. Asbestos. Yeah, blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.44,0:31:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"火灾隐患"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.44,0:31:19.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fire hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.44,0:31:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}树林是火灾隐患吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.44,0:31:22.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wood is a fire hazard?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.36,0:31:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}树林是火灾隐患 不 我不接受
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.36,0:31:25.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Wood is a fire hazard. No, I won't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.28,0:31:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"平等法案" 没错 平等法案
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.28,0:31:27.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The Equality Act? There we go: Equality Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.96,0:31:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我就知道会被你注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.96,0:31:29.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I knew you'd pick up on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"该经营场所目前没有划定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:34.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"There is currently no designated accessible parking spaces
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.68,0:31:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}无障碍停车位"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.68,0:31:35.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}at the property."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.08,0:31:38.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为谁划定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.08,0:31:38.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Designated for whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.64,0:31:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想他们的意思是 残疾人停车位
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.64,0:31:42.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, I think what they mean is for, er, disabled parking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我以为平等是指种族
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:44.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I thought "equality" was "race".
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.16,0:31:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}方方面面都要平等 是吗 我不知道 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.16,0:31:47.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Equality's everything, isn't it? Oh, is it? I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.52,0:31:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们捡重要的说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.52,0:31:48.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can we cut to the chase?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.60,0:31:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们要我们花十万英镑修公厕 十五万英镑修屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.60,0:31:53.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So they're saying 100,000 for the lavatories and 150,000 for the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.84,0:31:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所有勘查报告都是胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.84,0:31:56.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All surveys are bollocks
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:31:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每份报告都会说"这栋房子快塌了"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:31:59.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause they all say, "This house is falling down."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.28,0:32:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这份报告没这么说 它说的是"这个酒吧快塌了"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.28,0:32:03.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, this one didn't. This said, "This pub is falling down."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一点都不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:07.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们说了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:09.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But no, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.16,0:32:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们说"这栋建筑" 不管叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.16,0:32:11.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They just say, "This building, whatever it is, is falling down
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.80,0:32:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"快塌了 十分钟内肯定会塌"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.80,0:32:13.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and will definitely fall down in ten minutes."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.96,0:32:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如此一来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.96,0:32:15.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because then,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.56,0:32:17.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果真的 在十分钟内塌了 你也告不了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.56,0:32:17.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}if it does fall down in ten minutes, you can't sue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.72,0:32:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们就是在推卸责任
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.72,0:32:21.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-This is just them covering their arses. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.28,0:32:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这份报告真的 扔进垃圾桶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.28,0:32:23.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So this can really just be... put this in the bin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.56,0:32:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我会把它放进文件里 我有一份文件
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.56,0:32:26.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll just put it in a file. I've got a file.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.52,0:32:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我要走了 谢谢 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.52,0:32:29.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. I must get on. Thanks, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.56,0:32:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以我惯有的注重细节的精神 搞定了这场会议后
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.56,0:32:35.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Having dealt with that meeting with my usual attention to detail,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.96,0:32:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去查看阿兰的工作进展
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.96,0:32:37.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I checked in on Alan,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.92,0:32:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他正忙着用科茨沃尔德的优质石料 为我的新谷仓砌外墙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.92,0:32:42.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}who was busy cladding my new barn in handsome Cotswold stone.
