Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.08,0:36:52.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on here. Come on here! Come on here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.56,0:36:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.56,0:36:53.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, bollocks to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.76,0:36:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每个人都知道性爱是必要的 就是不知道该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.76,0:36:59.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Everybody knows sex is needed but they don't know how to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.44,0:37:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它有点像十多岁的孩子 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.44,0:37:02.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He is a bit like a teenager, though, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.48,0:37:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它是一头小 它们都是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.48,0:37:04.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because he is a young... Well, they all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们跑来跑去的 像是一场元媛舞会
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:07.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So they are running around like a debutantes' ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.04,0:37:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 终局
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.04,0:37:09.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, Endgame.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.24,0:37:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拿出行动让我们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.24,0:37:11.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's have a look at you in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.84,0:37:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 搞反了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.84,0:37:14.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no! It's the wrong way round! Wrong way round!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.72,0:37:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么会有母牛骑公牛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.72,0:37:18.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why did a cow mount the bull?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.20,0:37:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}又搞反了 反了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.20,0:37:20.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wrong way round again. Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.64,0:37:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 那头母牛可能发情了 对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.64,0:37:23.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}She might be on heat, look. She might be on heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.36,0:37:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在是母牛想要骑公牛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.36,0:37:26.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But she's the one that's trying to mount him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.56,0:37:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这算是 我也是吗 是不是有点这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.56,0:37:31.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that "Hashtag MeToo" this? It is, isn't it, a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.28,0:37:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么是"我也是"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.28,0:37:33.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What is "MeToo"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你明知故问 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:36.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know what that is. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:37.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Hashtag MeToo"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.76,0:37:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托 别告诉我你没听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.76,0:37:40.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Please tell me you've heard of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.56,0:37:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是一个色情网站吗 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.56,0:37:44.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Is that a porn site or something? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.32,0:37:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}刚好相反 正好相反
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.32,0:37:46.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's kind of the opposite. It's the exact opposite of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.12,0:37:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不明白 我根本没必要说话 因为我不
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.12,0:37:50.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't understand. There's no point me even talking 'cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.92,0:37:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}又搞反了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.92,0:37:53.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh! It's the wrong way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.68,0:38:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那天晚上我睡不着觉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.68,0:38:02.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That night I didn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.92,0:38:05.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我在担心酒吧的事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.92,0:38:05.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was worried about the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.32,0:38:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以第二天一早 在签订合同之前
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.32,0:38:09.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So the next morning, before signing on the dotted line,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.68,0:38:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定找买过酒吧的朋友聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.68,0:38:14.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided I should talk to various mates who'd bought pubs in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.68,0:38:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}确保我不会铸下大错
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.68,0:38:18.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to make sure I wasn't making a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.76,0:38:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.76,0:38:21.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning. Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.28,0:38:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}首先是我数十年的好友
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.28,0:38:25.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I started with a chap who's been a dear friend for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.24,0:38:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你有什么建议吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.24,0:38:28.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So have you got any advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.32,0:38:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（皮尔斯·摩根）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.40,0:38:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}人们会偷酒吧的东西 每个酒吧老板都会这样跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.40,0:38:31.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}People steal stuff from pubs. Every publican will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.80,0:38:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们会偷盐罐 胡椒罐 刀叉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.80,0:38:35.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They'll nick the salt-and-pepper pots. They'll nick knives and forks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.48,0:38:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}甚至连盘子都偷
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.48,0:38:36.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They might even nick plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.12,0:38:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}墙上挂的画也不放过
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.12,0:38:39.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They'll nick any art they can rip off the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.68,0:38:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 酒驾是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.68,0:38:42.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Obviously drink driving's an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.08,0:38:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在乡下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.08,0:38:44.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.36,0:38:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在乡下 所以你最好是找一个
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.36,0:38:46.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In the countryside. And that's why you want it kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.44,0:38:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}位于城镇中心的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.44,0:38:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In some central hub somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.00,0:38:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那里人多 可以走路回家
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.00,0:38:51.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}erm, where there are just a mass of people so they can walk home,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.36,0:38:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也可以轻松叫到出租车
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.36,0:38:52.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}or they can easily get taxis home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.84,0:38:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这家酒吧附近一栋房子都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.84,0:38:55.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's nowhere near any building of any sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.76,0:38:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最近的村子也有八公里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.76,0:38:58.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The nearest village is five miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.08,0:39:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 如果你运气好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.08,0:39:01.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Maybe, if you're lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.28,0:39:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也许他们会放宽针对酒驾的法律
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.28,0:39:03.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}maybe they'll relax the drink-driving laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来每个礼拜能赚五万
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:06.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You look at it, and it looks like you're making fifty grand a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.08,0:39:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（盖·里奇）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.08,0:39:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后一下子变成每个礼拜亏一万
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.08,0:39:09.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then it transpires you're losing ten grand a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.96,0:39:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有招工的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.96,0:39:11.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then the staffing issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.16,0:39:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道 现在招工特别难
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.16,0:39:14.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you know, staffing, it's so tricky nowadays
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.56,0:39:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为没有人愿意接受酒吧的工作时间
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.56,0:39:16.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause people just don't wanna work those kinds of hours, it's hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.48,0:39:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}通常几乎全是国外劳工
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.48,0:39:18.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Normally they're kind of almost overseas labourers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.80,0:39:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以只要英国脱欧不成功 你就没事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.80,0:39:22.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So again, as long as Brexit doesn't go through, you're gonna be fine as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.84,0:39:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}能源成本
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.84,0:39:25.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, energy costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.40,0:39:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}用人成本 原材料成本
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.40,0:39:28.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Staff costs. Ingredients costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.32,0:39:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}建筑维护成本
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.32,0:39:30.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Building maintenance costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.88,0:39:33.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}保险费用 会计费用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.88,0:39:33.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Insurance costs. Accountancy costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.04,0:39:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}修剪草坪的费用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.04,0:39:36.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, lawn-keeping costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.56,0:39:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}重新铺屋顶的费用 对我来说是重新铺茅草
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.56,0:39:40.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Re-thatching costs in my case. Re-gravelling costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.48,0:39:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}修补停车场的费用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.48,0:39:42.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Mending-the-car-park costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.28,0:39:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}招工成本 如果我还没提到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.28,0:39:46.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hiring-the-staff costs, if I haven't said that already...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:49.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.84,0:39:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在无数人 劝我不要买酒吧之后
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.84,0:39:53.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}after this avalanche of naysaying about pub ownership,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.36,0:39:53.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（风车酒吧 场地出租与餐厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.52,0:39:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我做出了一个重大决定
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.52,0:39:56.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I made a big decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.08,0:39:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道这是什么花吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.08,0:39:59.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know what this flower is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.60,0:40:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.60,0:40:02.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.84,0:40:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这棵树
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.84,0:40:04.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.04,0:40:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.04,0:40:06.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.24,0:40:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那盆植物
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.24,0:40:10.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That plant pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.00,0:40:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.00,0:40:12.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.52,0:40:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那个酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.52,0:40:13.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That pub?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:16.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.72,0:40:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.72,0:40:20.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}These are the keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.40,0:40:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我买下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.40,0:40:23.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I bought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我之所以如此开心 是因为有了酒吧之后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:30.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The reason I was so happy is that now I had the pub,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.96,0:40:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的农业合作社又可以搞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.96,0:40:36.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I could put the farmers' cooperative back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.64,0:40:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这一次 合作社会更大 也更好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.64,0:40:43.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And this time it would be bigger and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.92,0:40:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}经营酒吧所需的各种原料
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.92,0:40:49.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Instead of buying what we need to operate the pub
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不向肉店 酒商和批发商采购
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:53.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}from butchers and wine merchants and wholesalers,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.68,0:40:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}全部找农户采购
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.68,0:40:55.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we buy everything from the field
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.08,0:40:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从而让农户受益 不让批发商受益
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.08,0:40:58.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to benefit the farmer rather than the wholesalers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.56,0:41:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这样很好 对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.56,0:41:00.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That will be good. Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.88,0:41:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}英国出产的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.88,0:41:01.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}British-grown stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.84,0:41:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以从世界各地进口
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.84,0:41:04.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We could import everything from the four corners of the planet
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.56,0:41:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们不会这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.56,0:41:05.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but we're not gonna do that.
