Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.92,0:41:07.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're not having coffee and we're not having Coca Cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.88,0:41:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是英国出产的东西 我们一律不卖 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.88,0:41:10.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If it's not grown and reared in Britain, we're not selling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.48,0:41:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们采用这样的方式 比方说 你负责一月和二月的供货
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.48,0:41:14.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If we get into a system of like, for example you supply January, Feb...
