Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.04,0:41:16.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You supply, you know, May.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.04,0:41:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你懂我意思 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.04,0:41:17.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you see what I mean? Yeah.
