Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.04,0:41:19.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-So you do the lorry and the asparagus. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.44,0:41:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你负责羊和火鸡 好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.44,0:41:22.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-You do the sheeps and the turkeys. The turkeys, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.60,0:41:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}奶油 牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.60,0:41:23.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Cream, milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.92,0:41:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 猪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.92,0:41:25.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Pigs.
