Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.44,0:41:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}黑莓 芦笋 洋蓟
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.44,0:41:34.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}blackberries, asparagus, artichokes.
