Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.24,0:41:35.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}-Rhubarb? Do you do rhubarb? We do a bit of rhubarb.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.00,0:41:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}牛肉 羊肉 鹅 火鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.00,0:41:38.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Beef, lamb, geese, turkeys.
